# ─── Resend Email Service ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Get your free API key at https://resend.com
# 1. Sign up → Dashboard → API Keys → Create API Key
# 2. Copy the key (starts with "re_")
# 3. Paste it below for local dev
# 4. In Vercel: Settings → Environment Variables → add RESEND_API_KEY
#
# ⚠️  NEVER commit the real key — this file is for reference only.
RESEND_API_KEY=re_your_api_key_here
